{"about_the_game":"Phobos Down is a twin stick shooter stripped down to the bare essentials with focus on smooth controls and satisfying action.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754880/extras/48138dc38d999348dc8eca37ad4b17e5.poster.avif?t=1757321375\" width=600 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754880/extras/48138dc38d999348dc8eca37ad4b17e5.webm?t=1757321375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754880/extras/48138dc38d999348dc8eca37ad4b17e5.mp4?t=1757321375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>You're a lone corporation contract worker sent to salvage lost cargo on a distant uncharted planet full of hostile lifeforms. Mow down waves of unique enemies earning access to better equipment and customize your weapons to suit your play style. Protect the cargo and survive to enjoy your rewards.<br><br>You can play unique randomized missions or weekly challenges where everyone play the same game and compete for the highest scores.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Contract fulfilled","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2754880/cba09a4cf910d8aef3bd83051e8870e3d2b7b157.jpg"},{"name":"Reliable contractor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2754880/d34b43462dad7d7d593c91f45b75d2863069f67e.jpg"},{"name":"Trusted contractor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2754880/4c4e04e7a4307dd4a75fc802fec51ee0e79ce6ae.jpg"},{"name":"Primary contractor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2754880/d2a2950bfe9110508b7ac815bf476988295ca0c1.jpg"},{"name":"Never give up","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/275488